                    and race
                    against other players to reach the target score first. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100"
                data-command="/mathtea" title="click to copy command">
                <h5>!mathtea start &lt;pts&gt; &lt;difficulty&gt;</h5>
                <p> Challenge your calculation skills in a fast-paced math battle. Choose a difficulty, solve problems
                    before
                    your opponents, and be the first to reach the target score. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200"
                data-command="/animetea" title="click to copy command">
                <h5>!animetea start &lt;pts&gt; &lt;category&gt;</h5>
                <p> Think you know your favorite anime? Answer anime questions, and compete against other players to
                    claim
                    victory. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300"
                data-command="/jumbletea" title="click to copy command">
                <h5>!jumbletea start &lt;pts&gt;</h5>
                <p> Scrambled words appear one after another in this rapid-fire word game. Unscramble them before
                    everyone else
                    and race to reach the target score first. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" data-command="/gktea"
                title="click to copy command">
                <h5>!gktea start &lt;pts&gt;</h5>
                <p> From science and history to entertainment and everyday facts, test your general knowledge against
                    other
                    players and race to the winning score. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300"
                data-command="/geotea" title="click to copy command">
